`,u.jsx(t.p,{children:"In Ethiopia, tech adoption is accelerating. Initiatives in digital transformation—such as expanded connectivity, fintech adoption (like Telebirr and local banking APIs), and government digitization—show immense potential. However, key structural hurdles remain."}),`
